WEBVTT

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.330
We're finally on our field trip!

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.670
Let's take loads of photos!

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:13.600
Yeah!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.110
I can't wait to eat some green tea ice cream!

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.880
And then some boiled tofu while I'm at it!

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.520
We can try them all!

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.780
I wanna get a photo with one of the maiko...

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:24.200
Yeah, let's do that!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.320
Oh, I just can't wait!

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.280
Please, Miyuki-san, calm down.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.490
Here, say ahh.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.060
Ahhh...

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.230
Thanks! I brought some sweets too, so feel free to help yourselves!

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.980
Candy!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:45.470
Thanks for those-kuru!

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.780
Is something wrong?

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.710
O-Oh, no, nothing!

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.420
Those were yummy-kuru...

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:56.440
Well, I'm not gonna get mad at you today!

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.510
Kuru?

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.160
"Why" you ask?

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.740
Because I'm <i>ultra happy</i> today!

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:08.030
And why is that? Because we're off on a fantastic trip of a lifetime!

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.060
Do try and stay quiet on the train, Hoshizora-san.

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:12.000
Yes, ma'am...

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:16.460
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:18.290
Smile Precure!

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:19.190
Let's go!

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.730
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:21.860
All together!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.460
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.670
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:28.340
Smile Precure!

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.170
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:38.610
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:38.980 --> 00:01:43.820
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:49.760
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:54.700
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:54.660
So bright!

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:59.870
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:06.310
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:06.810
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:07.980
Let's go!

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.680
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:13.610
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:18.420
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.990
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:20.650
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:21.790
Everybody!

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.460
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.990
Fly to the future!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.500
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.670
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.970
Smile Precure!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.670
Whoa, it's huge!

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:46.890
Is that the Tsuutenkaku Tower?

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.640
That's Kyoto Tower, Miyuki-san.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.350
Now, I want you all to be aware we're not here for fun.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:56.410
Make sure you don't bother any people around the city.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.320
Understood?

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.790
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.500
Whoa, it's the Golden Pavilion!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.700
Officially, the temple is actually called the Rokuonji.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:15.770
That thing's really made of gold?

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.300
I wonder how much it cost?

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:22.200
They spent two years restoring the color, from 1985 to 1987.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:28.580
They used approximately 200,000 sheets of gold leaf to do it, at a cost of over 700 million yen.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.050
700 million yen?!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.700
How much studying have you done for this, Reika?

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.490
What? I was enjoying myself, so I got rather...

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.030
Hey look, there's koi in here!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.030
Really-kuru?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.350
Yeah, look!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.840
Hey, Candy?!

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.890
I didn't want to have to sit in the bus the whole time-kuru!

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.940
We had to travel in groups, we didn't have much choice!

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.040
Hey! Someone will see you!

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.530
Candy!

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.490
Say cheese!

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.060
Visiting Kyoto in a jersey sucks...

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.570
Well, that's life.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.710
Your uniform's still all wet, so, no helpin' it.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.290
Hey, you can get your fortune over there!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.910
Fortunes?! Let's go!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.040
Alright, I'm really lucky!

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:30.600
So am I, it seems.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.810
Slightly lucky? Eh, it'll do.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.280
"Maybe lucky"? Is that good or bad?

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.000
What's yours, Miyuki-chan?

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.480
Like you need to ask! It's gonna be really lucky!

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:42.860
Look, see!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.530
Atrocious luck!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.370
A-Atrocious...

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.720
Yup, atrocious.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.800
I've never actually seen atrocious before.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:56.180
You gotta watch your step, watch your stuff, and watch your stomach!

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.670
It's like misfortune is on parade!

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.990
B-But we're on our school trip...

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:03.050
I've been looking forward to this for ages...

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.650
There's no way I wouldn't get really lucky...

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:08.880
Now you mention it, you did get shouted at on the train.

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.870
And you fell in that pond.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.620
That is quite atrocious luck.

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:15.210
B-But hey, it's kinda good in a way, right?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.860
I mean, you're as bad as it can get! Can only go up from here, right?

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.260
Y-Yeah... I guess you're right.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:25.100
I bet the rest of the trip will be tons of fun, right?

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.180
Y-Yeah!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:26.760
Right?

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.700
Y-Yeah...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.040
Is it raining?

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.510
No, it's just bird poop.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.600
Alright, you have some free time for the rest of the day.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:38.680
Don't be late coming back!

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.010
You see this place on TV a lot, don'tcha?

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:44.140
This is one of Arashiyama's most well-known landmarks, the Togetsu Bridge.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.640
It's 154 meters long in total.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:49.310
You're like a human guidebook, aren't you?

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:51.980
Let's all take a photo here!

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.490
Excuse me!

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.830
Thank you very much!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.310
Let's see...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.550
Miyuki-san's face...

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.800
It's cut off...

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.540
Ah, well. We can take another!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.400
Excuse me!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.250
Thank you very much!

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:12.690
Let's see...

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.180
It's all blurry...

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:17.840
Another bad one?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.150
Now what?

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.370
We try until we succeed!

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.160
Why?!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.900
Why can't we at least get one good picture?!

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.530
The battery died...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.540
That's adorable!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.090
I think I'll get this for mom!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.310
Kuru.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.030
I'll take this one, please!

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.390
Okay!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.220
Are you alright?!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.390
Two ice creams, please!

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.310
That's delicious!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.930
Hey, don't start without me!

00:07:04.310 --> 00:07:06.010
Wait for me!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.520
Look at all the bamboo!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:16.080
Whoa! Now we're really in Kyoto!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.950
It's like the Tale of the Bamboo Cutter-kuru!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.180
Miyuki! I command that you bring me sweets-kuru!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.150
You already ate all my sweets, Candy!

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.510
Then bring me more-kuru kuru!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.790
That's not even how that story goes!

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.620
Is it alright?

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.130
I think...

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.640
so...

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.380
Well, it looks alright.

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.340
That's good, at least.

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:51.710
Thanks for the food!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.320
That was a lovely bath.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:03.520
The water in the pond was cold...

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:07.230
I hope mom likes my present.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.790
I hope mom doesn't hate my present.

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:14.280
This atrocious luck is really something...

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:19.440
When you sigh, your happiness disappears!

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.910
She's right, you know.

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:24.620
I'll get you for that!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.450
Jeez!

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:30.920
Pillow fight-kuru!

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:31.790
Bring it on!

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:36.240
Please, everyone, this is most unladylike...

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:42.600
Here it comes!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:53.710
You girls get some sleep now!

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:01.900
Go to bed already!

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:04.180
We're sorry!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.910
She was shoutin' at us for ages...

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:14.900
Yeah...

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.770
Sorry, it's my fault.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:20.070
Oh, don't blame yourself, Miyuki-chan.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.970
Sounds like it's time for a forfeit!

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:26.890
Miyuki-kun, you'll have to tell us who you have a crush on!

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.140
M-M-My crush?!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.530
Well, Miyuki-san? Is there someone you have your heart set upon?

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.710
W-Well, umm...

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:37.220
Is it somebody we know?

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:40.370
I guess...

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:43.660
Who?! Who is it?!

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:45.810
Let's start close - is it Toyoshima?

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.540
He's a really cheery guy, after all!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.660
Maybe you like President Irie, the mature type?

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.930
Clever, refined, popular...

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:53.700
As a long shot, how about Munemoto?

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.540
With a heart as big as the rest of him!

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.100
Miyuki-chan, give us a hint!

00:09:58.100 --> 00:09:59.520
Well...

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.570
He's kinda lean...

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:03.640
Right, okay.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:06.250
And he never ages...

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.680
Okay, got i- Wait, what?

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:12.290
Because the one I love is~

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.960
Peter Pan!

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:23.130
Oh god, I admitted it!

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:31.540
This is so embarrassing!

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:34.140
Go to bed already!

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:35.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.560
Fine, fine. Let's sleep.

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:41.730
Okay...

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:42.800
Miyuki-san?

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:43.780
Yeah?

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:46.010
I'm sure tomorrow...

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.700
Things'll be better.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.260
Don't let that fortune get you down.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:53.730
Okay...

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:56.080
Goodnight, everyone.

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.970
Goodnight.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.940
Long, long ago...

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:09.160
The villagers lived in fear of the monstrous oni that terrorized them.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.280
Now that's how an oni's gotta be-oni!

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.050
Kyoto, the ancient capital...

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:18.520
Hey! That looks just like the town in this story-oni!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.720
Maybe I could go there and...

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.200
Alright! I'm off to Kyoto-oni!

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:30.690
Happy!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:37.600
Candy!

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.440
The weather's nice!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.680
<i>Today might just be a better day!</i>

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:53.580
I didn't know that Kiyomizu's stage was sloped.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.620
You could roll all the way down if you slipped...

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.220
What... was that sound?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.990
The sound of Miyuki rolling away!

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.230
Thanks, Nao-chan...

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:11.640
Is Miyuki-san still...?

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:13.800
I think she might still have that bad luck...

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:16.770
Oh, don't be silly!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.610
It's still atrocious...

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.050
Are you alright, Miyuki-chan?

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.960
Want us to call an exorcist?

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:32.230
It's not that bad! I can cope, really.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.190
You sure?

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.770
I'm totally sure!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.510
At least she's not as depressed about it as she was yesterday...

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.100
I wonder why...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.740
Ta-da!

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.350
So this is Gion, huh.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:50.370
It's like a period drama here!

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.610
Where's a maiko?!

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.180
I've gotta get my photo taken with one!

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:55.360
I don't think there are any...

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.720
Wonder where they are....

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:59.920
Time for the Lipstick Décor-kuru!

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.250
Lipstick Décor?

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:05.660
Let's Go: Lipstick!

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:12.330
Do take all the photographs you wish-kuru.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:16.670
I think we'll stick with the mental image, thanks...

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:20.280
I guess entertainers like them won't just be wandering the streets.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.200
We'll just have to hope we run into one.

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.820
Which means we need to be lucky, huh.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.400
<i>Like, the opposite of me!</i>

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:36.350
Having me around with my bad luck is just gonna stop you from finding one...

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:39.170
You're over-thinking it!

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.280
But...

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:44.350
Kyoto! A heaven for an oni like me!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.060
No! The perfect hell-oni!

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:49.760
Now, humans! Tremble in fear before me-oni!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:50.850
Look, it's an oni!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.770
Where's my camera? I wonder what they're filming...?

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:54.140
Say cheese!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:56.940
How dare you-oni!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:59.440
I'll make you see how scary oni really are-oni!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.180
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:06.020
...a Bad End-oni!

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:10.490
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:22.190
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, oni!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.590
It can't be...!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.740
Stop that at once!

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:38.250
Precure! What are you doing here-oni?!

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.980
That's our line!

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:43.120
Here in Kyoto I'm in my element-oni!

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:45.330
Looks like luck's not on your side to meet me here-oni!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.310
Luck?

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.260
I've got good luck-kuru!

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:52.160
Hrm? What's this?

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.530
Hey, that's my-!

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:56.790
"Atrocious luck"?

00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:59.800
W-Well...

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:06.510
Atrocious-oni! This Precure actually got atrocious luck-oni!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:08.710
It's not that funny!

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.670
This is my chance, then-oni!

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.220
Come out, Akanbe!

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:20.260
Akanbe!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.060
An atrociously unlucky Akanbe...

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.460
I wanna go home!

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.530
Not the time to wimp out!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:27.660
Let's go, girls!

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:32.720
Ready?

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:36.000
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.250
Go!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.680
Go, go!

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:41.380
Let's go!

00:16:09.380 --> 00:16:12.470
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:15.580
Cure Happy!

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.300
Dazzling sun!

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.260
Hot-blooded power!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.850
Cure Sunny!

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:30.570
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.550
Cure Peace!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:39.130
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.380
Cure March!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:48.310
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:51.160
Cure Beauty!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.720
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:06.030
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.730
Akanbe!

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:15.000
Happy!

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:19.440
Akanbe!

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:25.210
Happy!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.290
You're really out of luck-oni!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.690
This is nothing!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.620
Leave this to us, 'kay?

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:36.330
Sunny!

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.840
Precure...

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.270
Sunny Fire!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.200
The heck?!

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:57.810
It's true, then... our attacks really are ineffectual against these blue-nosed Akanbe.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.810
Then use Precure Rainbow Healing-kuru!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:01.380
Right!

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:10.300
Her Smile Pact fell in the river!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.300
How bad is your luck?!

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.120
Go get it-kuru!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.840
Okay!

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.030
Time to finish you!

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.470
Ah crap, where is it?!

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.080
Are you okay?!

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.250
What a bunch of idiots-oni!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.620
If you just ditched that girl, you wouldn't have to put up with her bad luck-oni!

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:43.580
It's my fault... it's my fault they're suffering!

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:46.480
Let's end this!

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:49.470
I won't let you!

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:55.780
Happy!

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.190
I'm so, so sorry...

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.880
It's all my fault...

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:07.050
Thanks to you, I had fun despite my bad luck, and I could keep going...

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:12.300
But now you're all getting caught up in it too!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:13.360
I should just...

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.690
Happy!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:17.640
You haven't caught us up in anything!

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:23.510
We're just the same way! We were having fun because you were with us!

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.470
We could keep going because you were there for us!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:30.060
Are you really calling this kind of challenge atrociously unlucky?

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.440
As long as the five of us are together...

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.910
that's all the luck we could want!

00:19:36.220 --> 00:19:37.580
You really...?

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:46.360
My Smile Pact!

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.060
But how-oni?!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.980
This is nothing for us!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:54.230
One, two...

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:55.400
Five!

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:58.700
Akanbe!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:04.910
Now, combine your powers-kuru!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:11.430
Let's go!

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.670
Precure...

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.660
Rainbow...

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.700
Healing!

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.600
Akanbe...

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:46.070
These blue noses are useless-oni!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.390
Thanks, everyone...

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:55.190
We didn't get to do what we wanted thanks to my luck, but...

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:58.480
Huh? What is it?

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.730
Sorry, it's just so funny to think about...

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:06.070
We were talking about falling on that stage, and you go and do it!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:13.140
And that time you fell in the pond and scared all the koi away...

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:19.000
And making a fool of yourself by wearing your jersey for the class photo...

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:23.360
And getting that ice cream in your face...

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.830
You're meanies...

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:35.290
But I guess it is kinda funny, that my luck was that bad!

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:38.500
Hey, look!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:42.210
There's some maiko!

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:45.640
But why? I've got such bad luck...

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:48.050
"Fortune blesses those who smile."

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:51.580
By smiling, we can all find our own luck, or so they say.

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.980
See, it's like you always say, Miyuki-chan!

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:57.020
Hey, I guess so...

00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:00.090
Well, come on then, all together!

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.560
Happy!

00:23:39.910 --> 00:23:41.250
Our school trip...

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:42.500
reaches its final destination at last!

00:23:42.520 --> 00:23:43.900
My birthplace, Osaka!

00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:47.440
You know, I've never actually eaten takoyaki...

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:49.040
Seriously? But it's so good!

00:23:49.270 --> 00:23:52.800
Alright then, I'll show ya a seriously good takoyaki place!

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:54.080
Hey, where's Miyuki?

00:23:54.080 --> 00:23:54.800
Yayoi-chan?

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:56.430
Candy's not here either!

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.320
Smile Precure:

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:04.440
Find your ultra happy smile!
